EXPECT_HAS | d1/events.txt | 7 31 60 120 230 People1 1 2 1 B | B-in-block-2-(blue)
EXPECT_HAS | d1/events.txt | 10 31 60 190 90 People1 2 2 1 C | C-in-block-3-(green)
EXPECT_HAS | d1/events.txt | 13 31 230 200 50 People1 3 2 1 D | D-in-block-4-(yellow)
RUN | $T/pb/gc.+x | $T/pg/chutes | $T/pgs | ledger_hash
EXPECT_OUT_IS | $pl_h0 | THE-PAGE-IS-A-PROJECTION-the-ledger-hash-is-unchanged
